OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed over plot to smuggle
OL,4,Acocaine in cheese
OL,5,
OL,6,FFifteen men who were part of a gang
OL,7,Fwhich distributed up to #1.4bn of
OL,8,Fcocaine smuggled into the UK hidden in
OL,9,Fcheese, chocolate spread and cod mince
OL,10,Fhave been jailed.
OL,12,FThe criminal network, described by West
OL,13,FYorkshire Police as the "largest
OL,14,Fcriminal enterprise" the force had
OL,15,Fdismantled, was estimated to have moved
OL,16,Fmore than 4.5 tonnes of drugs across
OL,17,Fthe north of England in just 18 months.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
