OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed over plot to smuggle
OL,4,Acocaine in cheese
OL,5,
OL,6,FSentencing the men at Leeds Crown
OL,7,FCourt, His Honour Judge Christopher
OL,8,FBatty said those involved were
OL,9,Fresponsible for distributing
OL,10,F"astronomical sums" of cocaine.
OL,12,FDet Insp Kevin Daly described organised
OL,13,Fcrime groups as "very ingenious in
OL,14,Fcoming up with different ways to be
OL,15,Fable to hide the drugs".
